 v. Holman\">394 U. S. 478</a></span> <em>(1969) ; Maxwell </em>v. <em>Bishop, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9424284\"><a href=\"/opinion/108155/maxwell-v-bishop/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Maxwell v. Bishop\">398 U. S. 262</a></span> (1970); and <em>United States </em>v. <em>Jackson, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9423662\"><a href=\"/opinion/107657/united-states-v-jackson/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: United States v. Jackson\">390 U. S. 570</a></span> (1968).</p>\n<judges id=\"Av1W\">Mr. Justice Black dissents.</judges>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}